        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk programme on large cream silk in black typography with black printed border with picture of clown between two seated horses eating from tables.  Produced for 'The Farewell Benefit of Mr Wallett, Evening Dreams of Wonderful and Classical Equestrianism', including comedy, acrobatics and 'The London Citizen', also advertising Thursday and Saturday's entertainment programmes, Wallett's Royal Arena Nottingham, 9th May 1849."@en ;
